    "intro_narrative": "You awaken aboard the Genesis-7, a deep-space research station adrift in the void. Emergency red lights bathe the corridors in an eerie glow, and the artificial gravity hums inconsistently. The station's central AI, M.A.T.H.I.S., has initiated a complete lockdown protocol due to an unknown critical anomaly, trapping you in the main control sector. Life support systems are failing, and your only chance of survival is to reach the emergency escape pod. However, the pod's release mechanism is shielded by multiple layers of complex cryptographic overrides. You must navigate the abandoned labs, reboot dormant subsystems, and decipher the complex network of data streams left behind by the missing crew. Can you restore the data flow and override the system before the oxygen runs out?",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
